    "body": "Target from the maintainer, 2026-11-16:\n\n> \"the performance needs to gget down under 10ms to be useable\"\n\nDone means, in addition: on `fig8.step` with an edge selected all around the part, a frame without a change takes less than 10 ms. This replaces the weaker condition \"not slower than with no selection\".\n\nNote: the frame with no selection is 145 to 170 ms today (`scene` about 80 ms, `ui` about 65 ms). Thus the target also needs the base cost of the model's edge set to go, not only the cost of each selected chain. The worker reports the frame time that stays and where it is, and files the rest as a new issue if it is in the hover path of #2201.\n",
